# ORF-4D-2 incident notification dispatcher cron example.
# Prefer launchd on macOS workers when possible.
# Do not place webhook URLs or other secrets in this file.
#
# The dispatcher CLI loads /Users/admin/instagram-worker-python/.env itself.
# It only checks account_incidents and sends Slack/Discord notifications
# according to INCIDENT_NOTIFICATIONS_* flags; it does not launch runner.py
# or any Instagram device flow.

# Every 2 minutes:
*/2 * * * * cd /Users/admin/instagram-worker-python && /usr/bin/env bash -lc 'python3 scripts/dispatch_incident_notifications.py >> logs/incident_notifications_dispatcher.out.log 2>> logs/incident_notifications_dispatcher.err.log'

# Alternative every 5 minutes:
# */5 * * * * cd /Users/admin/instagram-worker-python && /usr/bin/env bash -lc 'python3 scripts/dispatch_incident_notifications.py >> logs/incident_notifications_dispatcher.out.log 2>> logs/incident_notifications_dispatcher.err.log'
